:name: Snapshots on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: Run, `Save @file`, run on, `Load @file`: the machine continues from the saved state.
$elf?=$ex_out/snapshot_demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "snap"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../stm32f4_blackpill/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
# try in the monitor: start; pause; Save @/tmp/x.save; start; pause; Load @/tmp/x.save; mach set 0; start
